                <div type="edition" xml:lang="okz-Latn" rendition="class:83231 maturity:83213">
<p>
   <lb n="1"/>sabbhamassatu sūstī srīya sabbhamaṅgala bahulacestā
   <lb n="2"/>jaiỵātīreka 1616 nnakkhsatra saka caha khaeha bīỵsā-<!-- kuch: jai.ỵātīreka ; ˘saka ; bī.ỵsā -->
   <lb n="3"/>ka thṅaiya buddhabārasāranā man [g]i Isa jaṁnuṁma sagha phoṅa<!-- kuch: sa^gha -->
   <lb n="4"/><g ref="sym:gomutra" type="punctuation">.</g>pubitra neḥ gi roḥ trīyabitdha succaritra sārddhā mahāvip[[u]]la
   <lb n="5"/>Atula Attirekka Ekaragatā prāmodajoti paṅkacca su-<!-- kuch: Ekaragatā, there is a symbol of daṇḍaghāta on the letter ra.  -->
   <lb n="6"/>ccaritra rinubindha Ācintrini ppirocca sugandhara pavara
   <lb n="7"/>paduṁmmābbhā mahā<add place="below">atti</add>sraiỵ sumaiỵ sumahuttaṁma saṁma nū Ā-<!-- kuch: srai.ỵ ; sumai.ỵ -->
   <lb n="8"/>saghārika sūccarītravaccā satyā Ādisṭhāṇa pranidhāna nai saṁ-<!-- kuch: ˘saghārika -->
   <lb n="9"/>taeca pūbaejña māna braḥ hr̥daiỵ kāta taṁmlāha sārddhā moka soeppa<!-- kuch: hr̥dai.ỵ ; ˘kāta -->
   <lb n="10"/>sāṅa taṅa duṅa phgaṅa nū taṅa {2} Ascāra biỵbārṇa nū saṁtaeca braḥ rā-<!-- kuch: bi.ỵbārṇa -->
   <lb n="11"/>jjasumuṅgala mahāsagharājja kravala nū Isa bhikkhu sagh<!-- kuch: mahāsa^gharājja ; sa^gha -->
   <lb n="12"/>phoṅa nū saṁtaeca braḥ mahāOpāsikā syiṅa moka juoya A-
   <lb n="13"/>nnammodānnā brama lmama niṅa saṁtaeca pubvaejña samreca sāṅa
   <lb n="14"/>thvāỵ braḥ śrīya ratnatrai dāṁṅ 3 khmi nū Isa Opāsaka dāyu<!-- kuch: thvā.ỵ ; dāṁ.ṅ -->
   <lb n="15"/>phoṅa syiṅa moka Annamodanā sāṅa thvāỵ brama lmama ni-<!-- kuch: Annamo,,danā -->
   <lb n="16"/>ṅa saṁtaeca pubvaejña taṁmnāca dāna prāka taṁmliṅa prāṁmpiya nū<!-- kuch: taṁ˘mnāca -->
   <lb n="17"/>spaṅa maraya traiya saṁmarāppa pūjjā dāna kuṁmrataeṅa<!-- kuch: ma,,raya -->
   <lb n="18"/>sagh phoṅa sāṅa jā sureicca taṁmnāca E s[[i]]takara kqama 5<!-- kuch: sa^gha -->
   <lb n="19"/>nāṁ.mraka kqama 2 jara magula hnāla mūỵ taeka madhuṅa sāṅa Isa<!-- kuch: nāṁ.mraka ; ˘jara ; mū.ỵ -->
   <lb n="20"/>taṅa duṅa dāṅ 9 thvāỵ mahāprasāththa daṁṅ 5 pañcāṁma kuśal prāṁ bā-<!-- kuch: ,,taṅa ; dā.ṅ ; daṁ.ṅ ; ˘bā- -->
   <lb n="21"/>n prasā nae[[ḥ]] hoṅ rīỵ Issa taṁmlaiya sitakara nāṁmrāka jara magu[[l]]a<!-- ˘ho.ṅ ; rī.ỵ ; nāṁ.m˘rāka ; jara -->
   <lb n="22"/>(22)	taeka 101 tappa sliṅa hoṅa <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g><g ref="sym:gomutra" type="punctuation">.</g>
   </p>     
